%% SaunaticaOS: durable two-phase charge plus reconciliation.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Staff POS / billing job
    participant API as Payment service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant GW as Card gateway
    participant RC as Reconciler (every 5 min)

    UI->>API: charge(customer, amount, idempotencyKey)
    API->>DB: Tx A - insert Payment PENDING (unique idempotencyKey, requestHash)
    alt key reused with a different request
        DB-->>API: conflict
        API-->>UI: 409 key misuse
    end
    API->>GW: sale(vault token, amount)
    GW-->>API: approved / declined
    API->>DB: Tx B - SELECT ... FOR UPDATE, mark SUCCEEDED, run fulfilment, audit row
    API-->>UI: result

    Note over API,GW: Crash between Tx A and Tx B leaves a PENDING row, never a lost charge
    RC->>DB: find stuck PENDING rows
    RC->>GW: query by transaction id
    alt gateway says approved
        RC->>DB: mark SUCCEEDED + fulfil
    else unknown after N attempts
        RC->>DB: mark UNKNOWN + open staff task
    end
    RC->>DB: find SUCCEEDED but unfulfilled, re-run fulfilment
